{
  "id": "ROM.12",
  "number": "12",
  "bookId": "ROM",
  "reference": "Romans 12",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ROM 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I beseech you therefore, brethren, by the mercies of God, to present your bodies a living sacrifice, holy, acceptable to God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your spiritual service. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And be not fashioned according to this world: but be ye transformed by the renewing of your mind, that ye may prove what is the good and acceptable and perfect will of God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I say, through the grace that was given me, to every man that is among you, not to think of himself more highly than he ought to think; but so to think as to think soberly, according as God hath dealt to each man a measure of faith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For even as we have many members in one body, and all the members have not the same office: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so we, who are many, are one body in Christ, and severally members one of another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And having gifts differing according to the grace that was given to us, whether prophecy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " according to the proportion of our faith; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or ministry, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to our ministry; or he that teacheth, to his teaching; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or he that exhorteth, to his exhorting: he that giveth, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " with liberality; he that ruleth, with diligence; he that showeth mercy, with cheerfulness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let love be without hypocrisy. Abhor that which is evil; cleave to that which is good. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In love of the brethren be tenderly affectioned one to another; in honor preferring one another; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in diligence not slothful; fervent in spirit; serving the Lord; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rejoicing in hope; patient in tribulation; continuing stedfastly in prayer; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "communicating to the necessities of the saints; given to hospitality. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bless them that persecute you; bless, and curse not. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rejoice with them that rejoice; weep with them that weep. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be of the same mind one toward another. Set not your mind on high things, but condescend to things that are lowly. Be not wise in your own conceits. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Render to no man evil for evil. Take thought for things honorable in the sight of all men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it be possible, as much as in you lieth, be at peace with all men. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Avenge not yourselves, beloved, but give place unto the wrath ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": for it is written, Vengeance belongeth unto me; I will recompense, saith the Lord. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if thine enemy hunger, feed him; if he thirst, give him to drink: for in so doing thou shalt heap coals of fire upon his head. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be not overcome of evil, but overcome evil with good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "ROM.13",
    "number": "13",
    "bookId": "ROM"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "ROM.11",
